{
  "meeting": {
    "id": "09bcfd444bbf4426a2c2f3c636863421",
    "title": "1",
    "status": "正式纪要已生成",
    "created_at": "2026-08-17T08:09:27.447045+00:00"
  },
  "transcript": [
    {
      "id": "divider-0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.0,
      "text": "新一段录音开始",
      "language": "zh",
      "speaker": null,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-0",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.8,
      "text": "能够看到我们身上各自的特长，也能够看到彼此身上的闪光。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 1,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-1",
      "start": 4.8,
      "end": 7.3,
      "text": "其实我们是三个很不相同的人。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 1,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-2",
      "start": 7.3,
      "end": 13.88,
      "text": "我是七零后，阿庞出生于八八年，是八零后，阿詹九零年，九零后，林伯克，UQ。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 1,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-3",
      "start": 13.88,
      "end": 15.84,
      "text": "比如说我今天来，对吧？",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 1,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-4",
      "start": 15.84,
      "end": 18.86,
      "text": "我感觉让我整个人是充更充满能量的。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-5",
      "start": 18.86,
      "end": 26.87,
      "text": "不会说星期一回去觉得更累了，反而觉得整个人人生态度更加的积极健康、有趣，是这样的一个改变。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-6",
      "start": 26.87,
      "end": 31.49,
      "text": "所以它其实从某种角度来讲，是一个彼此弥补的一个状态。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-7",
      "start": 31.49,
      "end": 33.45,
      "text": "嗯，不是一个彼此消耗。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-8",
      "start": 33.45,
      "end": 38.79,
      "text": "那比如说，呃，我以前上奇葩说，或者是去年跨界脱口秀啊，对吧？",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-9",
      "start": 38.79,
      "end": 41.46,
      "text": "也肯定有很多呃不如人意的地方。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-10",
      "start": 41.46,
      "end": 44.48,
      "text": "但是不如人意也没有打法，我为什么？",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-11",
      "start": 44.48,
      "end": 45.91,
      "text": "因为我还有一个。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-12",
      "start": 45.91,
      "end": 47.86,
      "text": "实在不行就回去上班呗。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-078c7672cf914248a51b06d43519485e-13",
      "start": 47.86,
      "end": 50.0,
      "text": "对，所以他们在某种角度。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-0",
      "start": 50.0,
      "end": 53.96,
      "text": "它是互相帮助的，也不能够完全看作两两种交往。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-1",
      "start": 53.96,
      "end": 60.25,
      "text": "哎，他这个说的一个好一点，就是要当人有不同的身份的时候，你给自己有推。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-2",
      "start": 60.25,
      "end": 64.75,
      "text": "如果我这个没做好的话，我本来做律师的不好，对不对？",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-3",
      "start": 64.75,
      "end": 65.47,
      "text": "对对对。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-4",
      "start": 65.47,
      "end": 70.32,
      "text": "万一做律师那个这种咨询，万一有一点点，我那个不好意思。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-5",
      "start": 70.32,
      "end": 78.24,
      "text": "我说，对，我说，就就像我这种没有推路的话，就有时候其实你缺一个托举你的东西，容易闪到腰。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-6",
      "start": 78.24,
      "end": 85.79,
      "text": "你这个你这个分析非常好，就上次在朋友圈里面说，我说这个世界上本没有爱，脚踏的船多了，",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-7",
      "start": 85.79,
      "end": 87.05,
      "text": "他就连出来了。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-8",
      "start": 87.05,
      "end": 88.31,
      "text": "这个梗响了吗？",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-9",
      "start": 88.31,
      "end": 89.93,
      "text": "当，呃，使劲响了。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-10",
      "start": 89.93,
      "end": 93.71,
      "text": "我就说为什么一个上班的电手还要来说中暑吗？",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-11",
      "start": 93.71,
      "end": 94.42,
      "text": "收藏瓜。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-12",
      "start": 94.42,
      "end": 94.96,
      "text": "对吗？",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-13",
      "start": 94.96,
      "end": 99.1,
      "text": "因为三个三个工作都同时抛弃我，这个概率比较小。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-b37ce71b04d341b79ff5c63523360f1e-14",
      "start": 99.1,
      "end": 100.0,
      "text": "千万不要。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-a58c08f289734405943d3b0eae4f01e6-a58c08f289734405943d3b0eae4f01e6-0",
      "start": 100.0,
      "end": 101.96,
      "text": "挑战老天爷！",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ce8a7495c824b17ae953d2cf6c9888c-a58c08f289734405943d3b0eae4f01e6-a58c08f289734405943d3b0eae4f01e6-1",
      "start": 101.96,
      "end": 105.88,
      "text": "你脱口秀已经满了抱歉了。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "divider-6117d8a1a72846fba30bcc3085725a8a",
      "start": 105.88,
      "end": 105.88,
      "text": "新一段录音开始",
      "language": "zh",
      "speaker": null,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "6117d8a1a72846fba30bcc3085725a8a-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-0",
      "start": 105.88,
      "end": 111.31,
      "text": "这里面还要分啊，这个政策和这个乡价，乡价的还要再分。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "6117d8a1a72846fba30bcc3085725a8a-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-1",
      "start": 111.31,
      "end": 120.28,
      "text": "所以我们那个时候口音也有比较深，就以耒阳话而言，我们也有城的耒阳话和这个乡下的耒阳话，",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "6117d8a1a72846fba30bcc3085725a8a-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-2",
      "start": 120.28,
      "end": 125.71,
      "text": "就是耒阳话，它也是要区分这个是标准性的还是非标准性。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "6117d8a1a72846fba30bcc3085725a8a-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-3",
      "start": 125.71,
      "end": 128.42,
      "text": "那您讲是标准性还是非标准？",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "6117d8a1a72846fba30bcc3085725a8a-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-4",
      "start": 128.42,
      "end": 130.93,
      "text": "我是标准性的，因为我是。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "6117d8a1a72846fba30bcc3085725a8a-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-5",
      "start": 130.93,
      "end": 133.85,
      "text": "李师炼最高端，李师炼最高端。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "6117d8a1a72846fba30bcc3085725a8a-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-6",
      "start": 133.85,
      "end": 137.4,
      "text": "对啊，那大家一般就会问你住在哪啊？",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "6117d8a1a72846fba30bcc3085725a8a-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-7",
      "start": 137.4,
      "end": 141.37,
      "text": "用我们耒阳话来说，嗯嗯嗯，呃，住在哪？",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "6117d8a1a72846fba30bcc3085725a8a-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-8",
      "start": 141.37,
      "end": 143.87,
      "text": "就是看那个，他是雄汉的。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    },
    {
      "id": "6117d8a1a72846fba30bcc3085725a8a-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-8c39d7d84eb8449d8ad1dc2be6182071-9",
      "start": 143.87,
      "end": 144.5,
      "text": "这没。",
      "language": "Chinese",
      "speaker": 0,
      "source": "实时会议",
      "kind": "speech"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "会议摘要：\n- 本次会议聚焦于团队成员间的互补关系与能量互动、多重职业身份下的风险管理与心理建设，以及方言文化标准性与地域差异的探讨。旨在梳理成员背景差异带来的协作优势，明确跨界尝试中的容错机制，并统一对语言使用场景的认知。\n- 主要讨论内容：成员背景与互补机制：会议回顾了团队成员的代际与背景差异（七零后、八零后阿庞、九零后阿詹及林伯克/UQ）。成员间能够清晰识别彼此特长与闪光点，形成年龄与经验上的互补格局。；能量状态与心态转变：通过近期互动与交流，参会者普遍反映个人状态由疲惫转为积极、健康与有趣。团队内部已构建起“彼此弥补”而非“相互消耗”的良性生态，有效提升了整体人生态度与心理能量。；多重身份与职业托底：结合脱口秀、律师咨询等跨界实践，会议探讨了在不同身份切换时如何设置“退路”与“托举”机制。成员一致认为，明确的职业底线与备用路径（如回归本职）能有效降低试错成本，避免因单一身份表现不佳而产生过度焦虑。\n\n关键结论：\n- 已确定：团队已确立“互补共生”的协作基调，代际与背景差异将转化为创新与执行的复合优势。\n- 已确定：多重身份并行需配套心理与职业双重保障机制，鼓励在可控风险内大胆尝试，避免因过度追求完美而抑制活力。\n- 已确定：语言与文化表达应坚持“场景适配”原则，标准性用于正式沟通，地域性用于文化认同，二者不可混淆。\n\n待跟进事项：\n- 待补充：梳理团队核心成员特长清单，制定内部协作与互补指引（高优先级）（待补充）\n- 待补充：开展方言文化微调研，明确耒阳话标准与非标准使用场景及适用边界（中优先级）（待补充）\n- 待补充：筹备下一次跨界经验分享会，固化积极心态与能量补给机制（中优先级）（待补充）\n- 待补充：建立多重身份实践的风险评估模板，完善职业“托底”预案（低优先级）（待补充）\n- 待补充：各负责人于本周内确认待办事项具体执行路径与时间节点。（待补充）\n- 待补充：持续跟踪成员互动中的能量变化，每季度进行一次协作模式复盘。（待补充）\n- 待补充：启动方言文化调研工作，形成简明使用指南供团队内部参考。（待补充）\n- 待补充：下次会议将聚焦“身份管理与跨界实践”主题，提前收集案例与反馈。（待补充）\n\n风险与问题：\n- 中：跨界尝试的专业边界与评价压力：在参与脱口秀等公开表达形式时，成员对“不完美表现”可能引发的负面评价存在顾虑。需进一步平衡创新尝试与专业形象维护之间的关系。\n- 中：方言标准性的界定与适用场景：关于标准口音与非标准口音的划分，目前缺乏统一的实操标准。在跨地域交流中，如何兼顾语言规范性与地方文化认同，仍需进一步探讨。",
